{
  "key": 12505,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "msg_0715_00000",
      "en_US": "Krise"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0715_00001",
      "en_US": [
        "You...\n",
        "You think I’m cool right?\r",
        "So how about we exchange phone\n",
        "numbers? {YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0715_00002",
      "en_US": "Don’t worry, you can call me anytime!"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0715_00003",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh, I see...\n",
        "Maybe I was overthinking things..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0715_00004",
      "en_US": [
        "I knew it! I knew you’d think I\n",
        "was cool!\r",
        "So, shall we trade phone\n",
        "numbers now? {YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0715_00005",
      "en_US": [
        "You must be really shy.\n",
        "If you’re nearby, you can come talk to\f",
        "me in person. It’s all right."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0715_00006",
      "en_US": [
        "My prized {STRVAR_1 0, 10, 0} is doing great.\r",
        "Which Pokémon do you like best?\n",
        "You should show me sometime."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0715_00007",
      "en_US": [
        "Hey, listen up!\n",
        "Yesterday we were fighting a wild\f",
        "{STRVAR_1 0, 11, 0}.\r",
        "I thoughtlessly used a Potion at the\n",
        "wrong moment, and it looked like we were\f",
        "going to lose.\r",
        "My Pokémon worked so hard. I really\n",
        "wanted to win, you know?\r",
        "Well, those kinds of things happen,\n",
        "I guess."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0715_00008",
      "en_US": [
        "Do you keep all the Pokémon you\n",
        "capture in PC Boxes?\r",
        "Me, I usually just let them go...\r",
        "That reminds me, I recently let this\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 0, 11, 0} go...\r",
        "That’s kind of a waste, isn’t it?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0715_00009",
      "en_US": [
        "Hey, what do you think about battling\n",
        "with me again?\r",
        "I’m at the {STRVAR_1 4, 3, 0}\n",
        "right now.\r",
        "Come on over!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0715_00010",
      "en_US": [
        "Hello?\n",
        "Do you remember your promise?\r",
        "We have to battle soon!\n",
        "I’ll be at the {STRVAR_1 4, 3, 0}."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0715_00011",
      "en_US": [
        "It wasn’t a very smart move to come to\n",
        "the Park in a miniskirt, was it...?\r",
        "I mean, these leaves keep scratching\n",
        "my legs..."
      ]
    }
  ]
}
